#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(8)(F) the rebuttal evidence is submitted in time` FALSE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (G): 60 days after rebuttal received on 1 June 2026 is 31 July 2026; with no rebuttal, 90 days after both were in on 2 March 2026 is 31 May 2026
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(8)(G) the last day for the administrative law judge's decision` (JUST (Date 1 6 2026)) (Date 2 3 2026) EQUALS Date 31 7 2026
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(8)(G) the last day for the administrative law judge's decision` NOTHING (Date 2 3 2026) EQUALS Date 31 5 2026
