§ `s 2025(c)(9) good cause`

#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9)(A) a natural disaster or civil disorder that adversely affects program operations` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9)(B) a strike by employees of a State agency necessary for the determination of eligibility and processing of case changes` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9)(C) a significant growth in the caseload in a State prior to or during a fiscal year` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9)(D) a change in the program or in another Federal or State program that has a substantial adverse impact on its management` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9)(E) a significant circumstance beyond the control of the State agency` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "includes": a circumstance not listed is not said to be excluded
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) the circumstance is good cause` `s 2025(c)(9) any other circumstance` EQUALS NOTHING
-- "such as a 15 percent growth in caseload" is an example
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(C) the growth in the caseload is a significant growth` 0.15 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(C) the growth in the caseload is a significant growth` 0.20 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(C) the growth in the caseload is a significant growth` 0.14 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `every declared type and constructor is used`

#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(A) a natural disaster or civil disorder that adversely affects program operations` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9)(A) a natural disaster or civil disorder that adversely affects program operations`
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(B) a strike by employees of a State agency necessary for the determination of eligibility and processing of case changes` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9)(B) a strike by employees of a State agency necessary for the determination of eligibility and processing of case changes`
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(C) a significant growth in the caseload in a State prior to or during a fiscal year` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9)(C) a significant growth in the caseload in a State prior to or during a fiscal year`
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(D) a change in the program or in another Federal or State program that has a substantial adverse impact on its management` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9)(D) a change in the program or in another Federal or State program that has a substantial adverse impact on its management`
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9)(E) a significant circumstance beyond the control of the State agency` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9)(E) a significant circumstance beyond the control of the State agency`
#ASSERT `s 2025(c)(9) any other circumstance` EQUALS `s 2025(c)(9) any other circumstance`
